--- note
Alpha-equivalent control for agg.scope.default-binder-nested-static.
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"A": {"kind": "column", "table": "t", "column": "a", "type": "NUM"}}
--- source
ANY((A, 2), P, ALL((P, 5), Q, Q > 0))
--- expect
(((`t`.`a` > 0) AND (5 > 0)) OR ((2 > 0) AND (5 > 0)))
===

