### name: agg.scope.outer-key-in-named-binder-body
--- note
`_K` in an inner static list under a NAMED outer binder is still the outer element's key.
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{}
--- source
ANY(("a","b"), o, ANY((_K, "zz"), c, c $== "2"))
--- expect
(((CAST('1' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin = CAST('2' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin) OR (CAST('zz' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin = CAST('2' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin)) OR ((CAST('2' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin = CAST('2' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin) OR (CAST('zz' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin = CAST('2' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin)))
===

