--- note
Alpha-equivalent control for agg.scope.outer-key-in-named-binder-body.
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{}
--- source
ANY(("1","zz"), c, c $== "2") OR ANY(("2","zz"), c, c $== "2")
--- expect
(((CAST('1' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin = CAST('2' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin) OR (CAST('zz' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin = CAST('2' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin)) OR ((CAST('2' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin = CAST('2' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin) OR (CAST('zz' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin = CAST('2' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin)))
===

### name: agg.scope.outer-key-compared-in-inner-body
--- note
The inner BODY reads the INNER key: `_K` is the innermost aggregate's key (SEL: ALL(("a","b"), o, ANY((_K, "zz"), c, c $== _K)) is FALSE), while the outer key in the inner LIST is still the outer one.
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{}
--- source
ALL(("a","b"), o, ANY((_K, "zz"), c, c $== _K))
--- expect
(((CAST('1' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin = CAST('1' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin) OR (CAST('zz' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin = CAST('2' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin)) AND ((CAST('2' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin = CAST('1' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin) OR (CAST('zz' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin = CAST('2' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin)))
===

### name: agg.scope.outer-key-compared-in-inner-body-control
--- note
Alpha-equivalent control for agg.scope.outer-key-compared-in-inner-body.
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{}
--- source
ANY(("1","zz"), c, c $== _K) AND ANY(("2","zz"), c, c $== _K)
--- expect
(((CAST('1' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin = CAST('1' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin) OR (CAST('zz' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin = CAST('2' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin)) AND ((CAST('2' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin = CAST('1' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin) OR (CAST('zz' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin = CAST('2' AS CHAR) COLLATE utf8mb4_nopad_bin)))
===

