### name: agg.scope.binder-named-like-a-column-in-its-own-list
--- note
`X` in the list is the COLUMN (the binder is not in scope until the body); in the body it is the element. Refused as E_SQL_DEPTH before.
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"X": {"kind": "column", "table": "t", "column": "x", "type": "NUM"}}
--- source
ANY((X, 2), X, X > 1)
--- expect
((`t`.`x` > 1) OR (2 > 1))
===

