### name: agg.filter.binder-does-not-leak-into-body
--- note
The FILTER's binder is local to its predicate. The aggregate body's free `X` is the column, not the FILTER element (`x` was once rendered as the element and the column never appeared).
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"X": {"kind": "column", "table": "t", "column": "x", "type": "NUM"}}
--- source
ALL(FILTER((1,2,3), x, x > 1), y, y < X)
--- expect
((((NOT (1 > 1)) OR (1 < `t`.`x`)) AND ((NOT (2 > 1)) OR (2 < `t`.`x`))) AND ((NOT (3 > 1)) OR (3 < `t`.`x`)))
===

