--- bindings
{"X": {"kind": "column", "table": "t", "column": "x", "type": "NUM"}}
--- source
ALL(FILTER((1,2,3), w, w > 1), y, y < X)
--- expect
((((NOT (1 > 1)) OR (1 < `t`.`x`)) AND ((NOT (2 > 1)) OR (2 < `t`.`x`))) AND ((NOT (3 > 1)) OR (3 < `t`.`x`)))
===

