### name: agg.filter.binder-is-undefined-in-body
--- note
SEL raises E_UNDEF_VAR for `a` in the body (the FILTER's binder is not in scope there); the translator raises E_SQL_UNBOUND at the same node, not a translation.
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"V": {"kind": "columns", "items": [{"table": "x", "column": "a", "type": "NUM"}, {"table": "x", "column": "b", "type": "NUM"}]}}
--- source
ANY(FILTER(V, a, a > 1), q, a < 9)
--- error
E_SQL_UNBOUND 1:29
===

### name: agg.filter.later-binder-is-undefined-in-earlier-predicate
--- note
`y` is the aggregate's binder, not yet in scope in the FILTER's predicate.
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{}
--- source
ALL(FILTER((1,2,3), x, y > 0), y, y < 9)
--- error
E_SQL_UNBOUND 1:24
===

### name: agg.filter.outer-filter-binder-is-undefined-in-inner-predicate
--- note
Nested FILTERs; `b` belongs to the outer FILTER.
--- dialect
mariadb
