{"V": {"kind": "columns", "items": [{"table": "x", "column": "a", "type": "NUM"}, {"table": "x", "column": "b", "type": "NUM"}]}}
--- source
ANY(FILTER(FILTER(V, a, b > 1), b, a < 9), q, q > 0)
--- error
E_SQL_UNBOUND 1:25
===

### name: norm.inline.def-not-captured-by-binder
--- note
`X2 = A` is written where `A` is the column; the later binder named A must not capture it when X2 is inlined. Expected: the binder renamed.
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"A": {"kind": "column", "table": "t", "column": "a", "type": "NUM"}}
--- source
X2 = A; ALL((5,6), A, X2 > 0)
--- expect
((`t`.`a` > 0) AND (`t`.`a` > 0))
===

