### name: const.binder-shadows-value-binding
--- note
A binder named V is the element, not the scalar binding V. It was treated as the constant and the column was left unguarded.
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"V": {"kind": "value", "value": "5", "type": "NUM"}, "A": {"kind": "column", "table": "t", "column": "a"}}
--- source
ALL((A, A), V, V + 1 > 0)
--- expect
(((CASE WHEN (`t`.`a` REGEXP '\\A-?[0-9]+(\\.[0-9]+)?\\z') THEN CAST(`t`.`a` AS DECIMAL(65,10)) ELSE NULL END + 1) > 0) AND ((CASE WHEN (`t`.`a` REGEXP '\\A-?[0-9]+(\\.[0-9]+)?\\z') THEN CAST(`t`.`a` AS DECIMAL(65,10)) ELSE NULL END + 1) > 0))
===

