ALL((A, 2), V, V + 1 > 0)
--- expect
(((CASE WHEN (`t`.`a` REGEXP '\\A-?[0-9]+(\\.[0-9]+)?\\z') THEN CAST(`t`.`a` AS DECIMAL(65,10)) ELSE NULL END + 1) > 0) AND ((2 + 1) > 0))
===

