{"ITEMS": {"kind": "relation", "from": "items", "alias": "i", "fields": {"DEPT": {"kind": "column", "table": "i", "column": "dept", "type": "TEXT"}, "QTY": {"kind": "column", "table": "i", "column": "qty", "type": "NUM"}}}}
--- mode
params
